[13.57477, "o", "truth verify-turn\r\n\r\n  ✓ Supported     I added the /v1/refund endpoint  (src/api.rs)\r\n  ✗ Contradicted  I set MAX_RETRIES to 5  (/tmp/acme/src/config.rs:1)\r\n  ✗ Contradicted  renamed parse_legacy to parse_v2\r\n  ✗ Contradicted  tests pass  (recorded 2026-06-11 18:17:40 UTC)\r\n\r\n  1 supported · 3 contradicted · 0 refused\r\n\r\n  ⚠ The agent's message contradicts the evidence above.\r\n"]
[18.082912, "o", "\r\n"]
[18.083012, "o", "\u001b[2m# Deterministic: verdicts come from the code, the git diff, and recorded\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[18.891306, "o", "\u001b[2m# test runs — never from a model. Listing a claim cannot make it pass.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[21.307298, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m# Don't trust the agent to call it? Make it a gate:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
