[22.91707, "o", "Installed Stop + PostToolUse(Bash) hook(s) in .claude/settings.json\r\n- Stop: the agent's final message is fact-checked; contradictions block until fixed.\r\n- PostToolUse(Bash): test/build/lint runs are recorded as receipts for \"tests pass\" claims.\r\n"]
